          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eanyuni Daudi apaki ŋin atemar aboŋoki Ekapolon iŋes analos ka Orenan a ŋolo arae Eyebusit, abu inak ŋamuronisya neni ke Ekapolon a nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, ayakasi eema ke Ekapolon ŋolo kitiyauni Moses analoŋisat ka Namuroet ŋina apeyere ŋainakineta nakibois ŋina amukur alo Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai pa abu Daudi tolot nen akiŋit Akuj ŋakiro ke eema a ŋol, anerae akuryana iŋes aŋuna a emalaika ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
